  "prefLabel": "Agr 2804.04 Monthly Submissions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 2804.04 Monthly Submissions. Each participating veterinarian shall submit complete and correct “Monthly Invoices” and the “Application for Sterilizing a Dog or Cat” no later than 10 days immediately following the end of that monthly period.\n\nSource. #5840, eff 6-17-94; ss by #6786, eff 7-1-98, EXPIRED: 7-1-06\n\nNew. #10568, eff 4-18-14; ss by #14129, eff 11-26-24, EXPIRES: 11-26-34",
